  "releaseNotes": "Security:\n- System.Security.Cryptography.Pkcs now comes in as a direct dependency with\n  a floor past CVE-2026-84008 and CVE-2026-70162: 8.0.2 on net8.0, 9.0.21 on\n  net9.0 and 10.0.13 on net10.0, each held below the next major. The package\n  reaches this library only through Microsoft.Data.SqlClient, and every\n  SqlClient 7.x asks for a version both advisories are written against, so\n  there is no SqlClient to move to and the floor is the only way the patched\n  version reaches a project that installs this one. Nothing in the API\n  changes, and a project that already resolves a higher version keeps it.",
